* ============================================================================
* 11b_table2_boottest.do — Wild cluster bootstrap inference (A1)
* Paper: {{PAPER_ID}}
*
* V2.0 J-L-M 2026 robustness alignment plan §3 Phase 2 P2.A1:
*   Wild cluster bootstrap on bank_id (G_bank=84) for main regression.
*   Per MacKinnon-Webb 2017 (J. Econometrics), G≥30 satisfies wild cluster
*   bootstrap regularity. G_year=2 in current panel → cannot cluster on year
*   (deferred to Stage B trigger T≥30).
*
* References:
*   - Cameron, Gelbach & Miller (2008, REStat) wild cluster bootstrap
*   - MacKinnon-Webb 2017 (J. Econometrics) small-G aspects
*   - Baron & Muir 2022 (RFS) narrow-panel SE practices
*
* Replaces conventional cluster SE p-value with wild bootstrap p-value
* for the main regression coefficient on {{ATTITUDE_VAR}}.
* ============================================================================

version 19
clear all
set more off

if "$data_dir" == ""    global data_dir "../data"
if "$tables_dir" == ""  global tables_dir "../output/tables"

use "$data_dir/_prepared_panel.dta", clear

set seed {{RANDOM_SEED}}

* Re-run main regression to set e() context for boottest
quietly reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}}_w {{ATTITUDE_VAR}} $controls, ///
    absorb(bank_type year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
display "Main β: " _b[{{ATTITUDE_VAR}}] "  SE (cluster): " _se[{{ATTITUDE_VAR}}]

* Wild cluster bootstrap inference (boottest >=4.0)
capture which boottest
if _rc == 0 {
    boottest {{ATTITUDE_VAR}}=0, ///
        reps({{BOOTSTRAP_REPS}}) ///
        cluster(bank_id) ///
        seed({{RANDOM_SEED}}) ///
        nograph
    display _newline "Wild bootstrap p-value (cluster=bank_id, G=84, reps={{BOOTSTRAP_REPS}}): " r(p)

    * Acceptance (AC-A1, plan §4): |p_wild - p_cluster| < 0.05
    scalar p_wild = r(p)
    quietly reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}}_w {{ATTITUDE_VAR}} $controls, ///
        absorb(bank_type year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
    * fix(omni-gapfill-16, 2026-06-12): p_cluster 由 normal() z 近似改 t(e(df_r))
    * — reghdfe 在 vce(cluster) 下按 t(G-1) 汇报 p 值 (e(df_r)=G-1), 旧 z 近似与
    * 表内 p 值口径不一致, AC-A1 差值含人为成分。
    scalar p_cluster = 2 * ttail(e(df_r), abs(_b[{{ATTITUDE_VAR}}] / _se[{{ATTITUDE_VAR}}]))
    scalar p_diff = abs(p_wild - p_cluster)
    display "p_cluster (cluster t, df=G-1): " p_cluster
    display "p_diff = " p_diff " (AC-A1: <0.05 required)"
    display "AC-A1 passes: " (p_diff < 0.05)
}
else {
    display "[WARN] boottest not installed. Run: ssc install boottest, replace"
    display "Wild bootstrap p-value unavailable; reverting to cluster SE only."
}

* Output appendix table with both SE methods side-by-side
* (Actual esttab output deferred to Phase 5 integration once boottest result
* is captured; this template runs as standalone diagnostic.)

display "[OK] 11b boottest diagnostic complete"
